note server/nopatch.om: seam used when patch/ is not composed (no READY file, or social or collab is
note a seam). /patches stays unclaimed (501 "coming" from server/route.om) and no upload is taken.
fn paroute to long
ret 0
end
fn paunl to long
ret 0
end
note pacount: patches of the repository fridx; 9999 = not measured (growth/g1prep.om grpatch)
fn pacount to ulong
ret 9999
end
